{"id":"en_the-beggar-queen-ls-the-ancient-god","title":"The Beggar Queen ls the Ancient God","titleEn":"The Beggar Queen ls the Ancient God","description":"Cast out as an orphan, she survives in a slave pit until her dormant abyssal bloodline breaks free. That awakening sets her on a path of conquest over warlords, knights, and frostmarshals. Joining forces with mortals, she launches an assault on the heavens themselves. There she uncovers the truth: the gods are impostors who seized the power of creation, while she is the genuine Genesis God, fated to take that power back.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-beggar-queen-ls-the-ancient-god/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-beggar-queen-ls-the-ancient-god/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Fantasy","Fantasy Romance","Underdog Rise","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dea4y/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-beggar-queen-ls-the-ancient-god_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dea4y/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-beggar-queen-ls-the-ancient-god_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dea4y/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-beggar-queen-ls-the-ancient-god_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dea4y/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-beggar-queen-ls-the-ancient-god_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dea4y/?pub=4occ